{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_09",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aaa4280ae5ca9ee3ed0fbdf6ef4cfd52b40e282710f308892cc917d33fa12100",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33eb7b03c77f1cfbd72959ecc6fdc0e817ebcae36d273fcc7c02c4943a684cf",
      "text": "可疑的男极，可疑的LIVE",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb551c995d07cd4c4811656dd991e6bd3ecbe521933293c0800050981d05588d",
      "text": "原定举办的男极“知识部门”被取消，\n男极联赛本身也唐突地迎来了尾声。\n尽管心生疑惑，315 Pro的众人还是开始回归日常。\n数日后，前男极主办方发来的一封邮件送到了他们手中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000023:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d811f7563c90e10ce6c36d183b8417e0e4362c281ceb20eccb2636b4f5ab7ada",
      "text": "第9话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000023:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33eb7b03c77f1cfbd72959ecc6fdc0e817ebcae36d273fcc7c02c4943a684cf",
      "text": "可疑的男极，可疑的LIVE",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85253d4f7d42ac04109920fbc80cb9b2016566d8bcdbd9babfebf4472594eb39",
      "text": "Hi！F-LAGS的各位。\n听说在同一个演播室，我就过来了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ef15186b8f544a88c7c283e999e020e97942c7c88bb8beb8b7a2860a41d85fa",
      "text": "哇，类先生！辛苦了。\n工作已经结束了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95433efe4bf1b5907c6b9dd7ec60a617f9310705a1f1dd65a17aa555bda04702",
      "text": "没～有，只是稍微休息一会儿～。\n你们呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c35940b0c8858e6fdf242dccde66c78d54832931dde9832af3ce08b2e1f352ac",
      "text": "俺们刚刚才结束！\n所以正说着要不要去瞧瞧类的情况哩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79ae243ef8d5fa8720308e9255eec8ea543389138542daeb89e6431ed24c1f90",
      "text": "Wow, nice timing！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cec14f671da846758480326b8bbf35f886fc2033c5cbb1369c99d8f8d1ca621",
      "text": "那，现在能不能占用一点时间，\n听听我的咨询呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:806b81906fd09a1d24e9475a2045c15e25fac010b24a31192b1679f54cdb607f",
      "text": "…当然可以。请问是什么咨询呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8061c9d296970afb9459183fc2ee6533694ae9df2a596f5ecce4d614256493e",
      "text": "其实，最近Mr. 硲有些消沉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36ffce897606e83b5c4a75e45326f2f6872655934b5fd34e970b33e083b36359",
      "text": "因为他一直期待的男极“知识部门”被取消了嘛。\n有没有能让他打起精神来的好idea呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56a7a2c51b02de96361370cc08906007c692759d5db60b1efb74b9ee80140af0",
      "text": "嗯……啊，做道夫先生喜欢吃的东西\n给他吃怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b1023191f4c345609b9fbb427fffbe9979243877d345d211bbb9f8620b2f23b",
      "text": "我完全不会做饭呀～。\n家里连冰箱都没有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000201:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faa0660e551867f2ab26345d7ad01b9d47b130bc5468b7cd566c491929e3623b",
      "text": "…向他推荐能让人沉浸于另一个世界的\n小说，怎么样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c72c08735c4e0e7cc6cce4f048d1402fa580677684d8630bb13128120f468eee",
      "text": "书啊～。漫画也可以吗？\n那样的话我或许能推荐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:137cb00ffaa68c0e69853dc0db882e4b448728b7b11bcdd67cb816497a340e03",
      "text": "哦，俺也喜欢漫画！用这种\n自己拿手的事去鼓励他，俺觉得挺好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000226:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:174d723592ce26d45ea84b72947deee64bc2775b03c725049e688bde5b8c8953",
      "text": "我拿手的事……\nEnglish、talk，还有smile吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa69cff5c602f45941ada69e83873cc9523ef21046189107f399ae9dcb253a8c",
      "text": "…我认为非常棒。\n因为笑容能带给看到它的人活力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30cec928dd61cce6cea5126735c6e37ccb77e97d28e479a45f2e313fffd1adef",
      "text": "嗯！大吾君的满分微笑也是这样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7560f0582d85be616171489e0d594b1f92025303f227f2c3a691aefbaa6203dd",
      "text": "那，发一张我和Mr. 兜的\nSMILE COLLABORATION PHOTO☆过去的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88f65d8eb8be03f81ae51797119049ddf1ba2aaa0821c5ed55cd882c221e6c89",
      "text": "Mr. 硲说不定\n也会变得活力满满了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed5030e7326e736b69c64be4e888674cd55ad439fc7287d75dcda47ea10beb27",
      "text": "噢。俺来帮忙，类！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f0fc30bcb21f0b1ca052c0a5fba3bdf7719e97f8d3568c0dc8a4000b0a88146",
      "text": "那就由我来拍照吧。类先生、\n大吾君，请露出最棒的笑容哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44c4ff1441eb756f66aaaa85a1f6fc209f7c1fab382970a9554ea52fae6653e6",
      "text": "Thank you☆\n嗯，最高级的满分smile♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31bd6b358486d4bd3819cd4a6abd3cbd7d3ef4b849589e27312a689ed9356829",
      "text": "说起来……Mr. 兜以前是第六代？\n曾是BIG group的leader对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c9a594bdafe5b40e33c56d041c41d64b9b470e4f46961ca7c4018a2734b5d19",
      "text": "我将来的梦想是当总理大臣呢☆\n要不要请Mr. 兜给我做一下lesson呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff7e54a44ed2dc7a51d1348b70d0a25dc3223e2d76ee23b4b87e4507c53d1ad3",
      "text": "不嫌弃俺的话，俺很乐意带你修行。\n然后俺们两个去当总理大臣和大臣吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d07a45f4c18349d5246e14c119191a4a6d2ab9b2dcabb482e18b65bd65e7b21c",
      "text": "…如果是大吾和类先生的话，\n感觉真的能当上呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cc17cc4ee22ecbc037e2cd2812c091a6ebc1ecccaeaa0ff301b2fd4ce80e63a",
      "text": "呵呵。315 Production要诞生\n满分笑容的领袖了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_b:cmd-000203:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a3dbb3f20039a748d23f15f0604e12e8f938a308e48d483343ab58ec94a8ea",
      "text": "（两个人份的smile，\n能让Mr. 硲也露出smile就好了啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc38463dfb89ed946217d105f0536b06ad72173ad5c9e55315a95f6cf2b34b3f",
      "text": "提问！\nIndian summer是什么意思呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bc662cfc8c0a30568ae1994bd64f8758f15aa48a6bdde76c71b68193cf0867a",
      "text": "好。答案是“小阳春”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31c8d8d302c6ccaa1135978e93660576d0ce1c1a410b4e9a19689235f93ec21",
      "text": "That's right！真不愧是Mr. 硲☆\n下一题是给Mr. 山下的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c39ea8c88154a8b7ca74282c40695d9433b37c4e70a265fd5c62a08d929a8517",
      "text": "来～啦。\n这学习会的成果，能在当天发挥出来就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a558d68d8c539714cdf296913f7bca1beafa0f01581fe72dcda09bf9718cfdb9",
      "text": "据说男极“知识部门”是要在参赛者中，\n角逐谁才是最具智慧的偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a52fc66c3c10a3ac844e9d7af96ab70a40d3c717eaeb372aedb0dc5ae558c713",
      "text": "当天想必会出涵盖各个领域的问题吧。\n虽说这样做了对策，但绝不可大意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e4a9c9e21c71362257904a9fbe3225932598d707c0851b65f4b518968aa157b",
      "text": "怎么感觉我有点回想起高考的时候了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ef65e8cbab2bd64422dbf6384dae9153d79017d9578edb92a2e540c76264781",
      "text": "稍微有些缺觉、\n天天埋头伏案的日子之类的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c21d78da54b934b16db6391d509d8d6759e5794c7c47af8a1181c2e7b242a917",
      "text": "我是跟friends互相出question，\n就像现在这样彼此support呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f556a5b24f7857f34d613dadfec7f5f32778d2d175b6fa12cbcef5065e20f1b",
      "text": "嗯。我也曾日复一日地伏案苦读。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce85d3e55fadfb01b3549c62ccab6f49b9df706f61542d896b4de7f95ba9da28",
      "text": "那时的我们尚且能做到。\n现在的我们绝无做不到的道理。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_c:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2be9560ee9437b3d798af5ffc915bc66ae6ce8442a51e7a9e630845e158dc949",
      "text": "两位，一起加油到当天吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7ef90919d0bb6a271fce71dc09f8d8f859b9157020620cdd2dc13d6033ae027",
      "text": "当天傍晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07d57c5f969095dc39eb7c2c3902182dbea62dea49f803f2279106a20022f27b",
      "text": "根据以往的竞猜节目推测，\n考到这个冷门知识的……可能性……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72ef578ccdfa7926a34e33bfeee98bd8247142c9dd14ba2fbc13d897098938c9",
      "text": "……唔，好困……\n但是，今天之内……要把这道题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad31190e069799d8f3016c7d39f58ff069c65a4301557707edf361f0c1289e4b",
      "text": "（这里是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b81e7a65dd14dc9ae5e0abbb6eb3179a9a604489b15b97c53d7b7268eed38e05",
      "text": "这个数字，是填在这里的吗……？\n可是，加起来就对不上了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b94176c8c3ac188e2bf6fc39ce9b978487a957c1363a6cfc9c9cab2f0c01def",
      "text": "……？是谁？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b86946fc7503669c5eb4d01334cb0cab5946ef65a1abe941ff3bfb3e39904f8",
      "text": "你是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb35bd34d14747f3c0275f8117c28969a7ad937b637b60f987e4cf25a5850c7f",
      "text": "……这样啊。\n是孩提时代的，我啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b71ea8191d83fedab18046daf8829b8fa793eca1a0cb25f90a234e087e08d1c8",
      "text": "大哥哥也是和我一样，是我吗？\n……好帅啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd324d13ce2314e8641e8ef7fe098cc86ac5a5237ae8d6ac1baca487de8e6da7",
      "text": "长大后的我，能长这么高啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac567b903c3a710d06fa7567c562f9e2186a993b378c9c757b0a4290fd014f46",
      "text": "大哥哥，再多跟我讲讲。\n关于长大后的我的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e7409a89b293cf18f9b9adfcb4e4b974a313fa3527a643d73241604c5b27acb",
      "text": "当然可以。长大后的我啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55ee88459fcfaca719e42214d91fbad501b2dffd87d87a0a690b31d1ca43ad27",
      "text": "能比你更流畅地算出更复杂的算式，\n也能解开超高难度的谜题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff25f37a42f5eaf910f5bc1be010361e811414c4187da9a63d173f8393cec3bc",
      "text": "那么，也能像爷爷和爸爸一样，\n成为优秀的学校老师吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e81bcecb6a1e6499b240b53c7a5c22bcad1df30fa415c85f7009f1ebc85cc07",
      "text": "嗯。\n……但是，你并不会一直待在学校里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b175463312f48103dd382705f243349d206b17d3354677e1b407460111c819ce",
      "text": "你会在另一个地方，与同伴们一起，\n教导许许多多的年轻人，实现梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1678924a0c263a67bbce5c0af78bad9d0229201690be5a9a86f81c7f2b50a1f",
      "text": "不仅运用学到的知识，还会借助歌声与舞蹈……\n讲授数学、英语，还有化学。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f910a25b9ca3430809ae29d86298e26b2801d5cffa8b9d1cc981977e4da0538",
      "text": "好厉害，能做的事情好多啊！\n可是，长大后的我，为什么穿着那样的衣服呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26fab51ce93894aa4077fb0b2a87ff660101f7ad8e9f7295314aa2f991baaa1",
      "text": "唔。这身装束是……咳咳。\n对我来说，也着实是非常出乎意料。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09717561a053685b4b5b22a65a5c1552a6612026e3dad25bbe9b353eb95835e4",
      "text": "请抱有自信，今后继续向前迈进吧。\n你的努力，必定会开花结果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000098:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a740d899e21a61a26cfed617310daa45603a2269ebfcda92e0bbac8be60b1dd9",
      "text": "“拍摄工作顺利结束啦”……\n好，给●●●●プロデューサー酱的联络完毕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cd88a0b755ec1f792bb135e64a13ee1cf8a3251c77a39c617d00b842d5984b9",
      "text": "……硲先生今天也待在那个地方吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce90875c2663ae3c346ff818e9f2487c345a4c84926d3ee2a0faea534e99fce",
      "text": "果然在这里。\n硲先生。这次的事，真的很遗憾呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ad1bd9423caada48c3e98051f0e6654a023eecbd6c4e0a237e6cd3452bf2414",
      "text": "没想到男极联赛和知识部门，\n居然会以这种形式突然结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000008:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82241d94ce053f77c429c978477bca8c31d2fccf9b1826eb3c5d6f26e77e793b",
      "text": "所以说，别让我重复那么多次！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19791e2d3877e8c519bd5654aa5337c097ef94d333cb3ec8eb7645b8364d5f2",
      "text": "所有的偶像都很出色，\n根本无法选出男极KING。因此……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73795f7d3832ba3b5d26ca63c1408a001cdfa36b332ab6de5a3ed5ecb3063b3",
      "text": "向在大会上表现优异的前5名事务所颁发男极奖。\n男极联赛在没有KING的情况下就此结束！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edd88d648d570bf2cf8e40f84bd980e82cdae91b55c29ebdb7980936f34c1809",
      "text": "……这种收场方式我们无法接受。为了\n男极KING努力拼搏至今的偶像们会伤心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be0e3cadc8cc7b933d151a66db26e250b0cf5252d35fee217712bb0125a716c9",
      "text": "对给予过关照的各家公司和工作人员，\n又该怎么交代啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ebf6e58b5cdf3b81871bb08e45fab23471efff5e23380d7d11bcb2c31ad67b0",
      "text": "至少把知识部门办完吧！\n准备工作眼看就要做好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c37033daf8f084e143f345487c4e93be3e572a5f70a91910151e4e5bf1f7325",
      "text": "不行，不行，立刻结束！\n要是知识部门也是对手们表现得更好怎么办？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f262e20617d0de46b9ceb335dabda76db526678f11d60f4938c48ff3232060e",
      "text": "我们事务所的颜面岂不是要丢得比现在更彻底了吗！\n……咳咳，不是这个意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb72859ceec65433ba6a0750a3db0973d8c570e361d99295d5b93c910173cdd",
      "text": "有关各合作方，用不着担心。\n我已经向几家说明过了，反而是对方在道歉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32fe757ef1af7324aaa157ad9280f5d1adea14df786937810009c491ae1ff97b",
      "text": "说是由于自己协助不力，\n才导致大赛出现了诸多疏漏，非常抱歉云云。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aca516263571fa4454681ac5eff71e309898ffb2637064acd1ed4e6447b18e5",
      "text": "（明明全是我在暗中搞鬼……哼，就算他们察觉到了，\n对着我也不敢说出口吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55f80de519d45b8f3d3bc44036c13411ed2bf6d611ed839024aa2b660bd0f670",
      "text": "再说偶像们不仅不会悲伤，反而会高兴吧。\n毕竟原本只有1个的胜者名额，增加到了5个啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6a617209c3357850b75b55cc05eefc02528055ce0a53bd80d475ebe7febdd5f",
      "text": "（……不过，我可不会平白无故就把男极奖给你们）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b194a1c8d29c64e3e4711beaf97c58bb38d11e641280d3e702f766bc49a42d",
      "text": "（你们三番五次打乱我的计划，\n我定要让你们付出代价。给我做好觉悟吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b727248457737265f509d6298f2edd6f8af52a8f3beff7565cdb1411107b76a3",
      "text": "自从决定出战男极之后，\n315 Pro的气氛就很热烈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc9d76cdfbc80473c615f4ab03816ec7c225008777a9a781dab5924591dfb6d0",
      "text": "我们事务所的三十多岁组也像社团活动一样聚在一起。\n讨论饮食啦、训练菜单啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c0765ebb985b970141ab8022657192e66fa365ad92f3f221e9892c3cad43abc",
      "text": "谁要是硬撑了，\n大叔之间还会互相体谅照应。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c90436c5288a990bcb910d24f1165d2661a1fa8fc49860d610a8f19c7d2f069",
      "text": "虽说大会最后有些唐突地草草收场，\n男极KING也没能拿到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ad685861d1784c28852b002fcd801fd2862783a779efeef635f9775da85f269",
      "text": "不过315 Pro也拿到了男极奖嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf053bec77dd9330467f3d3738d7b4825c708466a56c2cbe628edc57c0a342f0",
      "text": "……是舞田君发来的。\n这是……舞田君和兜君的照片？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d6f95e60594dfcc0ce383d01c5ba8655a500a1e819929109081c0b11d1b8cd",
      "text": "哈哈，笑得真灿烂啊。“把满分微笑\n送给Mr. 硲☆”，写着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bba3994a3aad591ab38ae084616cbc657af743ff9cd4ffcfb9b280f9d149c68",
      "text": "……人生中，绝无白费的努力。\n不论结果如何，付出过的努力都会化作力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fc897688977b37a779cd43ca8e7448c9189dcd10eb121135a900411e9af2c08",
      "text": "因此，对于未能拿下男极KING，\n以及获得男极奖这个结果，我并无不满。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c25c48b10300953bdd4566802bc8f321a748dfdb546ebe8c0243b96e43ed5f28",
      "text": "……即便是这样，我也依然想要挑战。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36609e7835b37c4427ca73e93b5ef0c5ec37e7bcaaed7cd65e026d3b5e48fe5",
      "text": "啊，那封信……\n是之前用鸽子和绑在箭上的信送来的那个吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60afa7c9183ad892bce1ce1a54455ca6d5901d6656377799a9d562ee0ee99a0a",
      "text": "嗯。正是那天让我心中热血沸腾的事物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9bd01cd4bca522d2caee2f508ee0993fc41649a7d2279f8bc605e66c356afb",
      "text": "为了回应这封信中的热情，\n我日复一日地投入特训与练习之中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8148cdfd65621584ae45c12bef5cdcd6b0ec3cc07ebc58f43ae9601f01011d09",
      "text": "……本想着将这样积累下来的力量，\n在大会上一展身手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6bf3d865f7d2dfd350ac182047bc05602b6dec6f30722bfe8003b8ed0c28b75",
      "text": "人只要怀抱目标、努力学习与拼搏，\n就能获得无限的成长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_g:cmd-000207:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e1fc46ac737d9f9fd4a55dc18616aa7b26fb69d9eb0e742754090a37607ea7",
      "text": "我想展现出这份美好。\n既向年轻人，也向我自己……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a035502924cf5396d3cb1c8dd01f33031f177ebce441259326fca3a63b2b67",
      "text": "那个……●●●●プロデューサー。\n前男极主办方发来了一封邮件。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b67f48be60974f913c9d47647ff40263ba0136917d1e894d39d21a20ee66a84e",
      "text": "“我们事务所近期将举办一场大型LIVE。\n各位务必前来参加！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9fa80e1d6c16b2b351475e586c8c617ff5af002ab270db2596dd4177938c06b",
      "text": "这封邮件，发给了所有\n获得男极奖的事务所呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7625d495c3c02e06c103cf5b16f4179e44bff4989d58bc6fab94a01f9859bed7",
      "text": "但是……看回信的情况，\n大家似乎都不打算参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b6eeb73fee3697f758c09ed16f1f7ddfdc20ea06cd2d8921e516aa388da1e37",
      "text": "恐怕这场LIVE，是为了让男极办得不如意的他\n宣泄心中的闷气，才特意筹备的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd73336f95f05c603134173baec59f378a411959d031192a7fb1245693ffb245",
      "text": "在他彻底满足之前，可能还会继续举办这种LIVE，\n甚至是第二届、第三届男极……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bceff8f4e680e71853680073eef2578a68c304bb7225bc7087fb65a2ef837b57",
      "text": "大家大概是判断不该与这种对手纠缠，\n才决定婉拒的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcb9eb97af4d52db3e33a855441292c15689dea2c72ba18572a7cd246119c3d0",
      "text": "我们这次最好也不要参加了吧。\n感觉会是场比男极还要可疑的LIVE……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb43b302422e68a6835eff5ca6ee7e0ca19571fa91825e107b8bdf28e1f4fb82",
      "text": "本想着来事务所露个脸……\n制作人酱你们看起来很忙呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30851a58c5298ebfddc4d38cca9988895fb53f705ad0a2a59149a5faed99174b",
      "text": "……硲先生，换个地方聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76abc857147fb755a8513006d2d58fd91f7f9de33e57308b6f40656e647cae2c",
      "text": "……嗯。就这么办吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000034:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05517401dd2e8fb64cdcf7e58a617cdb1bd85eb33e24c184790e61f830beaaab",
      "text": "诚司的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8609d4cfe235bb8b8285fe1d3a5204f22e41bef5d179df203ce1a7649e1648f1",
      "text": "事情就是这样，我们俩偶然听到了这番对话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79578e012c9e9afe633329b24b69539f38d1871dd884ae3ea618c058f6a04229",
      "text": "嗯——……那确实听上去\n会是一场很可疑的LIVE啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a07264254816bbef4f46be762e7dd3a7185ec4983d958aff84f89762d560733",
      "text": "男极也是在满是可疑名堂的情况下收场的，\n听说这回可能比那次还要过分呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58fd154f8c6b8469f7b6c8b9cd6f5d6d36094bf2abd3e59dd5c5e78ee42818b6",
      "text": "只不过，综合考虑之后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf2e01b34252b93f3901e10a0edd4d235e879aa35c30ef4476007f526ff66cf5",
      "text": "我打算找制作人商量，\n参加这场LIVE。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:958d58afd9084ce22e879166df9ef949f7638039907eeb16adaf87b35ab8bfe3",
      "text": "因为本以为已经错失的挑战机会，\n如今又重新出现在了眼前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19636a36c459a0bf84ead35d6ef56a42fdb1035983b4fb22964a1cb4e24ccf20",
      "text": "……他是这么说的。其他人打算怎么办？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88645271d33398db464e220c50d6ac9915a01569e4872424ad5a4b9f9de2ebf3",
      "text": "当然，我也要参加！\n毕竟那封信的回礼，我还没送完呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5429463d5bac4b7848144f6aa98cb94d9b88bbd1fb5b6f1328da9bc630d0f1c4",
      "text": "啊，“我会全力把你们打得落花流水，\n洗干净脖子等着吧！”……那封信啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f06e77fcfeed307aa84cded14b282cebe1a8776f13da5e676412dac46f1b357b",
      "text": "对对。本来以为能大干一场，\n结果男极就这么结束了，我还挺扫兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9176eb057345a0dcdc552d86d324e09d8099fb234778fe781005ab3cff4b4701",
      "text": "得参加那场LIVE，\n这次一定要让他们好好奉陪到底才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b980557dafdf5e70f00fb5c8299d12d69d734fd7feb157dc46ef53be105e8270",
      "text": "哈哈，也是啊。既然对方挑起了胜负，\n就得碰撞到彼此都满意为止才行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c44f7bbc14689017f2844e743b9833293d7446e8de144cf221b18eaeffe53b0",
      "text": "啊～顺带一提，我也打算参加。\n总不能丢下硲先生不管嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d30a3aeb4b7ecdccf993dd81be449bd74dfd2149295241722c33363318632d15",
      "text": "嚯。这样好吗？山下先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94aa530591bb2d6fba34280cc945f864cdedc1d091f2b15c95b6ae48f01424b3",
      "text": "正如你方才所言，这场LIVE\n恐怕不是那么容易对付的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f811af248b633dc4b52bb645fa305b709d4e12e70ca617b8127e27c3dc1fda23",
      "text": "哎，虽然是这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f29b90ab167753d386e0878da76a00ba7f4d162cc029ddfb2da2b46bcb3ede6",
      "text": "但正因如此，我觉得才更应该由大叔出马，\n而不是让年轻一辈去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40a41b3c87544f942ccbad7c86617406a43a26818df9c79cfa172d120c7e173b",
      "text": "我把这个阵容召集起来，\n也是出于这个原因呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:882784330b0c1d4a0b04b94becac5cefef11e6d14af2fd7b7f4a0bacad886194",
      "text": "次郎，真有你的！\n温柔、机敏，说得太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0220bbfdc0065b4233fe79370ece92073eadbc243ad77d4efd8786d1bdb594bd",
      "text": "毕竟我们有岁月的阅历嘛♪\n我们这边可也不是好惹的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21f375c0ba89c8bfc16f949d4edafd8c6f86b070610a2f234c5a9021ed454b3f",
      "text": "前辈们干劲十足啊。\n那么，最后葛之叶怎么说？算你不参加？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bb4f8f11430da0b3c1dbd1155f2c5e1ca8823037baf1ba65ec996e9c57ed844",
      "text": "怎么可能。要是参加这场LIVE，\n想必也能顺势进入对方的地盘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61cfd33bfaea128f7020b4673eaf7a615fbf10ec86aff16d68da3d59d64d6951",
      "text": "对我而言也是个绝佳的机会。我很乐意参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b7cb5a457b8c438e3dd2cadd0454d3f51b6c2dd3b5a9044e74be7ea82ebad7",
      "text": "……决定了啊。\n这场可疑的LIVE，就由我们接下了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "噢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47ed3bfb741b0810834a9ed8e80258cb5eea41bf228195d039b99132825df5e5",
      "text": "那么，给制作人酱打个电话吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000215:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99338d16006635901de6ed40fb78c3f81f9b00654e2deeec50ac59e7705a5641",
      "text": "……喂，●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000217:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:725dd8768edbfb99e16b9f6f736081ed3cc8a20fac01cd0625ecf1558249532c",
      "text": "其实啊，刚才在事务所听到制作人酱和\n贤聊的内容了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000219:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:830f77554968bfcb8d9213c91f4e2237d7db2f468b053e7d683b430a59fd1349",
      "text": "就是那个，前男极主办方\n发来LIVE邀请的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000221:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18b90517a70de1cf1cbe20b78070a6936ee78ac512115dd4e13068bd97a27ab6",
      "text": "哎呀～偷听了真是不好意思。那个，\n315 Pro这边是打算拒绝的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000223:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa77f28102b48e7fba9d7dc1ee16fa2020bde0ec9faa79a7fac0783e8c65995",
      "text": "刚才还在和贤君\n商量这件事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000226:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c985cd85ea03adc1bed5ae0a81a107a74545dfe661544c54a628e25519cafc12",
      "text": "这样啊。这么晚了还在为我们操心，谢谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000228:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:addc7b17cf0f568ca74e79a68b680630547e26148bbc2f342a3925e667f7f372",
      "text": "然后关于那场LIVE……\n现在我身边聚了一帮想出场的人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000231:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:162311c027514ea2f3bab8f78dc026cfef07a6fee109ddaecc654ab35eb141d3",
      "text": "稍等一下哦。……来，大家～\n电话那头是制作人酱哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000233:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfda9869f0bfd2ad6f85afc7d4a48ff7169324d01192c59a5bdf372f3d229bf1",
      "text": "想参加LIVE的人，答应一声～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000235:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a",
      "text": "在——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000237:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9455d6b55a0eb14c663b0b82eac96477a46bd5145106cbbf8fde6d5df7123d15",
      "text": "听到了吗？硲先生、渡边先生、\n信玄先生、葛之叶和我，一共5个人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000239:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52ae5ea73b9293e218b326c993f6448e6bb7aa635a048a730983ae87722e8bb9",
      "text": "就是这样，有人想参加。\n明天在事务所，再详细聊聊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000241:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:399925a6696de7788141bd709762b68f6bb8260cb01ae3fa4bf99f8ad2a34037",
      "text": "今天姑且就先辛苦啦。\n你们两个也早点回家休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_j:cmd-000243:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209d2d114e475e6b9101624586fbacee282840e1f1c93ea3f75b9b61cec49ca5",
      "text": "那，晚安咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
